<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Dossier verifie - AgriFund</title>
	<style>
		body {
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
			background: #f3f5f4;
			font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
			color: #1f2937;
		}
		.wrap {
			width: 100%;
			padding: 24px 12px;
		}
		.card {
			max-width: 620px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			background: #ffffff;
			border-radius: 12px;
			overflow: hidden;
			border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
		}
		.head {
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, #076A39 0%, #089647 55%, #B2D944 100%);
			color: #ffffff;
			padding: 28px 24px;
		}
		.head h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 24px;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}
		.head p {
			margin: 8px 0 0;
			font-size: 14px;
			opacity: 0.95;
		}
		.body {
			padding: 24px;
		}
		.badge {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 6px 12px;
			border-radius: 999px;
			background: #ecfdf3;
			color: #076A39;
			font-size: 12px;
			font-weight: 700;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.4px;
		}
		.intro {
			margin: 16px 0 18px;
			font-size: 15px;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}
		.info {
			background: #f9fafb;
			border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
			border-radius: 10px;
			padding: 14px;
			margin: 14px 0;
		}
		.row {
			display: block;
			margin: 8px 0;
			font-size: 14px;
		}
		.label {
			color: #6b7280;
			font-weight: 600;
		}
		.value {
			color: #111827;
			font-weight: 700;
		}
		.success {
			margin-top: 14px;
			padding: 12px;
			border-radius: 8px;
			background: #f0fdf4;
			border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
			color: #166534;
			font-size: 14px;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}
		.foot {
			border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
			padding: 16px 24px;
			font-size: 12px;
			color: #6b7280;
			background: #fafafa;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="card">
			<div class="head">
				<h1>Dossier verifie</h1>
				<p>Validation confirmee par notre equipe admin.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="body">
				<span class="badge">Valide</span>

				<p class="intro">
					Bonjour {{ utilisateur.prenom }},<br>
					Votre justificatif pour <strong>{{ achat.offre ? achat.offre.nomOffre : (achat.produit ? achat.produit.nomProduit : achat.reference) }}</strong> a bien ete verifie.
				</p>

				<div class="info">
					<div class="row"><span class="label">Reference dossier: </span><span class="value">{{ achat.reference }}</span></div>
					<div class="row"><span class="label">Montant: </span><span class="value">{{ achat.montant|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} {{ achat.devise }}</span></div>
					<div class="row"><span class="label">Statut actuel: </span><span class="value">Dossier confirme</span></div>
				</div>

				<div class="success">
					Votre dossier est maintenant confirme. Merci pour votre confiance.
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="foot">
				AgriFund - Notification automatique. Merci de ne pas repondre a cet email.
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
